# Smart Fella or Fart Smella — website environment variables
#
# The website itself requires NO environment variables to build, run, or deploy.
# It is a static-rendered Next.js marketing + quiz site with no runtime secrets.
#
# If you add configuration later:
#   - Prefix any browser-exposed variable with NEXT_PUBLIC_
#   - Put real values in .env.local (gitignored) — never commit them here.
#
# (no variables required)
